<title>USA: Omaha hogs off $1.00 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Omaha hogs off $1.00 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>OMAHA 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said barrows and gilts were</p>
<p>$1.00 lower. Trading was slow. Top $49.50 per cwt.</p>
<p>    US 1-3    230-260 lbs mostly 49.50</p>
<p>    US 2-3    260-280 lbs    48.50-49.00</p>
<p>   Sows - weak/off $0.50. Top $52.00.</p>
<p>    US 1-3    350-500 lbs    42.50-43.00</p>
</text>
